When you get an error:

You send me the error/code/screenshot.
I identify the problem.
Explain why it happened.
Give the correction.
Tell you how to prevent it next time.

8. Git & GitHub
We’ll use Git properly:

git init
git status
git add
git commit
git push

We’ll also create:

README.md
.gitignore
proper project structure
meaningful commits

9. Testing
We'll test:

normal inputs
wrong inputs
edge cases
unexpected situations

10. Improve the Project
After the basic version works:

V1 → V2 → V3

